'''''Rhagadiolus stellatus''''', or the '''endive daisy''', is a species of annual herb in the family [[Asteraceae]]. They have a self-supporting growth form and simple, broad leaves. Individuals can grow to 0.22 m.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Rhagadiolus stellatus (L.) Gaertn. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/509718|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Rhagadiolus stellatus (Star Hyoseris) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/ASTR/Rhagadiolus_stellatus.php |access-date=2022-03-07 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

